From 5087c160fe62e9b1c215dc58150ce98fca63a8e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tomaszstaniak <68373859+tomaszstaniak@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:37:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] virgl.hidd: fall back to softpipe when the host cannot run
 VirGL, report the reason in ENV:VirGL-Status, wait for replies by time
 instead of a fixed spin

---
 workbench/hidds/virgl/test/glcheck.c       | 12 ++-
 workbench/hidds/virgl/test/glstress.c      | 94 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 workbench/hidds/virgl/virgl_galliumclass.c | 53 ++++++++++--
 workbench/hidds/virgl/virgl_transport.c    | 90 ++++++++++++++++-----
 workbench/hidds/virgl/virgl_transport.h    |  6 ++
 5 files changed, 228 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 workbench/hidds/virgl/test/glstress.c

